<view class="screen verify-screen"><view class="header"><button class="secondary" bindtap="back">返回</button><text class="title">牌山验证</text><text class="pill">本地计算</text></view><view class="verify-columns"><view class="column input-column"><text class="label">{{source}}</text><textarea class="json-input" value="{{inputText}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="8388608" placeholder='{"matchId":"…","handNo":1,"dealerSeat":0,"rulesVersion":"friends-v2","shuffleVersion":"fy-hmac-sha256-v1","wall":[按顺序填写 108 个实体牌编号],"seedHex":"可选：64 位十六进制种子"}' aria-label="牌山或牌谱数据" /><view class="row"><button class="primary" bindtap="calculate" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">计算／验证</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="paste">粘贴</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="import">导入</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="sample">示例</button></view><text class="muted">牌序必须保持原始顺序，0–107 号实体牌各出现一次。填写 64 位十六进制种子还可复现洗牌。</text></view><view class="output-column card"><scroll-view scroll-y class="report-scroll"><block wx:if="{{report}}"><text class="report-status {{report.status === 'passed' ? '验证通过' : report.status === 'unverified' ? '尚未完整验证' : '验证未通过'}}">{{report.status === 'passed' ? '验证通过' : report.status === 'unverified' ? '部分证据尚未验证' : '验证未通过'}}</text><view wx:for="{{report.checks}}" wx:key="name" class="check"><text class="check-name {{item.status}}">{{item.status === 'pass' ? '✓' : item.status === 'fail' ? '×' : '?'}} {{item.name}}</text><text class="muted check-detail" selectable>{{item.detail}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{report.calculatedCode}}"><text class="label">重新计算的校验码</text><text selectable class="hash">{{report.calculatedCode}}</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="copy">复制校验码</button></view></block><text wx:else class="muted">导入完整牌谱，或根据对局信息和原始牌序计算校验码。验证过程在本地进行。</text><view class="gap"/><text class="muted">只有与本地留存的发牌前校验码一致，才能确认牌山与事先承诺一致。仅凭文件内的校验码，无法证明发布时间或种子选择是否公平。</text></scroll-view></view></view><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text></view>
